    "generated_at": "2026-08-05T06:01:38.652Z",
    "lint_pass": true,
    "what_en": "Claude scans the text for AI-like writing traces (banned words, formulaic sentence patterns, over-polished rhythm), rates the level as mild/moderate/severe, then rewrites them into more natural, colloquial prose, outputting a revision report with statistics; in file mode it directly rewrites files.",
    "when_en": "Triggers when the user says trigger phrases like \"去AI味\" or \"这篇太AI了\", or asks to check or polish web-novel text.",
